  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides MFIII partners in Bangladesh, Kenya, Myanmar and Zimbabwe the opportunity to attend and participate in national and/or international visits to further partners&apos; advocacy aims within the theme of sustainable, climate resilient livelihoods. This includes visits to international and national audiences &#x2013; conferences, advocacy visits to parliaments, international organisations such as the UN, FAO etc. For more information on the MFIII programme please see Programme ID: ICD651.</narrative>
